{"slug":"d-l-l","ar":"د ل ل","total":8,"core":"guidance; indication","forms":[{"ar":"دَلَّ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":7,"gloss":"to guide, show","word":null,"ex":{"s":61,"a":10,"p":5,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","هَلْ","أَدُلُّكُمْ","عَلَىٰ","تِجَـٰرَةٍ","تُنجِيكُم","مِّنْ","عَذَابٍ","أَلِيمٍ"],"en":"O you who have believed, shall I guide you to a transaction that will save you from a painful punishment"}},{"ar":"دَلِيل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"indication, guide","word":null,"ex":{"s":25,"a":45,"p":16,"ar":["أَلَمْ","تَرَ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكَ","كَيْفَ","مَدَّ","ٱلظِّلَّ","وَلَوْ","شَآءَ","لَجَعَلَهُۥ","سَاكِنًا","ثُمَّ","جَعَلْنَا","ٱلشَّمْسَ","عَلَيْهِ","دَلِيلًا"],"en":"Have you not considered your Lord - how He extends the shadow, and if He willed, He could have made it stationary? Then We made the sun for it an indication"}}],"surahs":[[20,2],[34,2],[7,1],[25,1],[28,1],[61,1]]}